   - `$POSTFIATD_DIR/validator-token.block`
   - `$POSTFIATD_DIR/set-domain-output.txt`
  +- `$POSTFIATD_DIR/postfiatd.cfg` and `$POSTFIATD_DIR/postfiatd.cfg.new` until the step above removes them
   
